tr.td:
Birth to less than 3 months
Starting dosage 0.5 mg/kg once daily;
may increase to 1 mg/kg once daily

3 months to less than 1 year
Starting dosage 0.5 mg/kg twice daily;
may increase to 1 mg/kg twice daily; Maximum of 40 mg per day

Starting dosage: 20 mg every 6 hours;
adjust dosage to individual patient needs
Maximum dosage 160 mg every 6 hours
